# Gauntlet run artifacts are per-machine measurements, not source. The page
# renders from the artifact the scheduled run produces; committing every
# nightly JSON would bury the corpus changes that actually need review.
gauntlet/runs/
# (was gauntlet/runs/*.json — the nightly launchd job also writes
# launchd.out/launchd.err there, which left the repo permanently dirty
# after the first scheduled run. A dirty tree is how a real change gets
# lost in the noise.)
